1
00:01:01,230 --> 00:01:02,560
<i>Send her to the kitchen.</i>

2
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:04,453
<i>Don't let her come up here.</i>

3
00:01:04,453 --> 00:01:07,551
<i>If you ever forget your place,
I'll pour it over your face.</i>

4
00:01:07,551 --> 00:01:11,200
<i>I have no idea how it video-called you.</i>

5
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:13,080
<i>Just tell Nat to come sign the divorce papers.</i>

6
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:16,240
<i>Do you know of any place
that's not too expensive?</i>

7
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,600
<i>You can stay at my place.</i>

8
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:18,680
<i>I'm hardly ever home.</i>

9
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:22,710
<i>Giving Nat drugs won't hurt him, right?</i>

10
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:27,000
<i>I've changed my mind. I'm not divorcing him.</i>

11
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,308
<i>He doesn't look well, just like you suspected.</i>

12
00:01:34,808 --> 00:01:37,306
You have a gentle touch, Kadkao.

13
00:01:38,316 --> 00:01:39,711
No wonder...

14
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:43,520
Master speaks so highly of you,

15
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:45,506
saying you're so useful.

16
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:49,724
I'm grateful to you, my lady,

17
00:01:49,724 --> 00:01:52,408
for allowing me to serve you.

18
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:03,520
I'm the one who should thank you.

19
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:07,513
But you know something, Kadkao?

20
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:11,703
Master once took in a stray dog.

21
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:16,298
It even brought him a snake
that had nearly bitten him.

22
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:19,880
He'd pat it on the head,

23
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:22,311
feed it and care for it fondly.

24
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:28,211
But one day, it forgot its place

25
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:31,720
and climbed onto my bed.

26
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:37,421
Do you know what I did to it?

27
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,315
No, ma'am.

28
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:46,800
I ordered the servants to skin it alive,

29
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:49,925
then threw its flesh to the vultures and crows.

30
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:53,428
A plaything is just a plaything.

31
00:02:54,160 --> 00:02:56,611
Master may enjoy something new,

32
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:01,106
but your place is on the ground.

33
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,896
Don't you dare reach for the treetops.

34
00:03:04,655 --> 00:03:06,021
Understand?

35
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:46,296
Yes, Pete?

36
00:03:46,296 --> 00:03:48,713
When are you going to sleep upstairs?

37
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:54,413
<i>I know you feel awkward because it's my room.</i>

38
00:03:58,600 --> 00:04:02,518
But go ahead and sleep there.
You'll be more comfortable.

39
00:04:03,926 --> 00:04:07,600
Okay. I'll go up in a bit.

40
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:11,520
I'll just stop by for a few things.

41
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:14,116
I won't be long or bother you.

42
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,420
Okay.

43
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,480
Looks delicious.

44
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:46,010
Would you like to eat now?

45
00:05:49,188 --> 00:05:50,600
How many spoonfuls?

46
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,205
One, please.

47
00:06:59,280 --> 00:07:00,880
Bastards!

48
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:04,808
I didn't want you to see something like this.

49
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,400
But I didn't want to lie.

50
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:14,315
They've been seeing each other for a long time.

51
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:17,598
Even before Pete and I broke up.

52
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:27,040
Is this why you got so drunk
and kept saying you wanted to come back?

53
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:31,546
I'm going to sue.

54
00:07:31,546 --> 00:07:33,827
Why make things complicated?

55
00:07:33,827 --> 00:07:36,993
Yo wants a divorce anyway. Just divorce her.

56
00:07:36,993 --> 00:07:40,511
I won't divorce her. I'll sue him for adultery.

57
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:54,778
Pam, if lawyers get involved,

58
00:07:54,778 --> 00:07:58,120
the police will find out
the clip is AI-generated.

59
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,864
That's easy.

60
00:07:59,864 --> 00:08:01,613
Just delete the clip.

61
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:08,090
We made it for Nat to see, not anyone else.

62
00:08:08,090 --> 00:08:12,814
As for everything else,
let Yotaka deal with it herself.

63
00:08:27,200 --> 00:08:28,712
<i>I have something to tell you.</i>

64
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:34,506
<i>Pam and Whan took Nat
to the great-grandfather's house.</i>

65
00:08:51,420 --> 00:08:52,620
Nat!

66
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,622
How are you?

67
00:09:03,400 --> 00:09:06,813
Fine, I guess. Seeing you cheat on me.

68
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:09,680
You're insulting me.

69
00:09:09,680 --> 00:09:12,120
Then why did you move in with him?

70
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:17,822
Didn't think I'd find out, did you?

71
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:25,809
Oh, the other man is here too?

72
00:09:25,809 --> 00:09:27,904
Stop being crazy, Nat.

73
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:30,456
You two are inseparable.

74
00:09:30,456 --> 00:09:34,310
You must be madly in love.

75
00:09:37,647 --> 00:09:40,200
It's good that Yo's found someone else.

76
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:42,584
You should just divorce her.

77
00:09:42,584 --> 00:09:45,619
Why waste time suing him for adultery?

78
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:48,830
You're here to talk divorce?

79
00:09:48,830 --> 00:09:50,280
Let me make this clear.

80
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:52,288
I'm not divorcing you, no matter what.

81
00:09:52,288 --> 00:09:53,828
But I'm suing him.

82
00:09:53,828 --> 00:09:55,813
I'll make sure he loses his job.

83
00:09:58,560 --> 00:10:00,546
You're talking just fine now.

84
00:10:00,546 --> 00:10:02,321
Not drowsy or confused anymore?

85
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,838
What do you mean?

86
00:10:05,838 --> 00:10:08,028
Are you saying Nat was drugged?

87
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,600
Wait, Pam.

88
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:14,914
I never said Nat was drugged.

89
00:10:18,363 --> 00:10:20,521
Did you actually drug Nat?

90
00:10:21,220 --> 00:10:24,617
Don't make accusations without proof.

91
00:10:28,010 --> 00:10:29,438
Nat.

92
00:10:29,438 --> 00:10:31,019
Are you okay?

93
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:34,640
The day you left me,

94
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,800
I was devastated.

95
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:37,080
I drank a lot.

96
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,927
I was completely wasted.

97
00:10:39,813 --> 00:10:41,718
You must've misunderstood.

98
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:45,127
No one did anything to me.

99
00:10:45,127 --> 00:10:46,617
Except you.

100
00:10:52,053 --> 00:10:53,801
I'll see you in court.

101
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:56,306
I'm suing him for adultery.

102
00:10:59,376 --> 00:11:01,303
You should go, Yo.

103
00:11:01,303 --> 00:11:05,521
The three of us are perfectly happy.

104
00:11:08,449 --> 00:11:10,306
Just wait for the summons.

105
00:11:11,054 --> 00:11:13,905
Then you'll know how Nat felt

106
00:11:13,905 --> 00:11:16,110
when you served him with one.

107
00:11:27,007 --> 00:11:28,819
Let me ask you honestly.

108
00:11:30,177 --> 00:11:32,504
Is he refusing to let you go,

109
00:11:33,292 --> 00:11:37,717
or are you the one who won't leave him?

110
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:49,680
You say there's nothing between you,

111
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:52,080
but you're living together.

112
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,600
Getting Nat to believe you

113
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,618
won't be easy, Pete.

114
00:12:09,741 --> 00:12:12,441
[Police]

115
00:12:14,549 --> 00:12:18,007
It wasn't a ghost watching you.

116
00:12:18,007 --> 00:12:19,521
It was Whan.

117
00:12:21,140 --> 00:12:23,240
Whan has a spare key to my house.

118
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:26,217
She probably snuck in, filmed us,
and showed it to Nat.

119
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:30,817
I don't care if Nat gets the wrong idea.

120
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:35,320
What worries me is

121
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:37,200
that Nat was drugged.

122
00:12:38,020 --> 00:12:39,706
But we have no evidence.

123
00:12:41,834 --> 00:12:47,020
Besides, Pam doesn't seem
to be after his assets or his life.

124
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:50,820
So your suspicion may be unfounded.

125
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:19,000
<i>If you truly love Master,
you must leave this place.</i>

126
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:22,840
<i>I can't leave yet. I care about Master Lert.</i>

127
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:25,680
<i>He'd be touched to hear that.</i>

128
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:30,432
<i>But I can't forgive a traitor like you.</i>

129
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:41,430
<i>Bulan, don't!</i>

130
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:58,219
<i>My lady...</i>

131
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:17,718
<i>Here. You can have Master's heart.</i>

132
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:45,280
From what you've told me,
your wife moved in with another man.

133
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:48,880
And they've been seen
going out together regularly.

134
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:54,115
But there's still no clear evidence
of a sexual relationship, correct?

135
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:57,293
Isn't that enough for me to sue?

136
00:14:57,293 --> 00:15:02,053
Then I'll have a private detective
take photos and videos

137
00:15:02,053 --> 00:15:06,513
clearly showing they're romantically involved.

138
00:15:07,726 --> 00:15:12,000
But there's one important thing
I need you to confirm.

139
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:16,440
You've never harmed or harassed your wife
in any way.

140
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:18,760
She left me for him.

141
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:20,415
She should be held responsible.

142
00:15:22,160 --> 00:15:24,718
Please handle everything.

143
00:15:24,718 --> 00:15:27,415
Nat just wants justice.

144
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:31,174
Then I'll have someone
start following them today.

145
00:15:31,174 --> 00:15:32,597
But let me be clear.

146
00:15:32,597 --> 00:15:37,600
That deleted clip must never resurface.

147
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:42,712
Otherwise, this whole thing
could come back on you.

148
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:46,116
You can count on that.

149
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:50,415
If there's nothing else, I'll take my leave.

150
00:16:02,895 --> 00:16:05,491
Why did you delete the clip you showed me?

151
00:16:05,491 --> 00:16:07,718
We could've used it as evidence.

152
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:12,594
Because I knew how painful
it was for you to see.

153
00:16:12,594 --> 00:16:14,554
I didn't want you dwelling on it.

154
00:16:14,554 --> 00:16:15,922
Even so,

155
00:16:15,922 --> 00:16:17,812
you shouldn't have deleted it.

156
00:16:27,334 --> 00:16:29,120
He's suing Pete for adultery.

157
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:32,215
Isn't Nat going to do anything about Yo?

158
00:16:36,603 --> 00:16:39,314
I think Nat has his own way
of dealing with his wife.

159
00:17:09,840 --> 00:17:10,874
Well?

160
00:17:10,874 --> 00:17:12,960
It's done, sir.

161
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:15,809
Good. I'll transfer the money.

162
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:18,733
Where's my wife's car now?

163
00:17:18,733 --> 00:17:21,016
It's parked outside the police station, sir.

164
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,520
Police!

165
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:36,902
I want to get Nat tested
for any drugs in his system.

166
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:41,480
Even if Nat was drugged,

167
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:43,160
it's been several days.

168
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:45,020
A test won't find anything.

169
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:50,001
Unless...

170
00:17:50,001 --> 00:17:51,318
Unless what?

171
00:17:51,318 --> 00:17:52,712
Test his hair.

172
00:18:10,241 --> 00:18:16,230
[Yo]

173
00:18:18,659 --> 00:18:20,640
What's up, Yo?

174
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:23,306
Can I have a strand of your hair for testing?

175
00:18:24,135 --> 00:18:25,520
<i>Sure.</i>

176
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:29,600
Then let's meet somewhere.

177
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:33,829
Pam and Whan aren't home.

178
00:18:33,829 --> 00:18:36,023
Why don't you come over?

179
00:18:36,023 --> 00:18:37,617
<i>I'm not feeling well.</i>

180
00:18:45,720 --> 00:18:47,019
Okay.

181
00:18:57,040 --> 00:18:59,520
Nat agreed to the test.

182
00:18:59,520 --> 00:19:02,320
I'm going to meet him
at his great-grandfather's house.

183
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:08,560
Pete.

184
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:11,620
Aunt Win just called.
Her nephew's out of the hospital.

185
00:19:13,120 --> 00:19:14,828
Want to go?

186
00:19:14,828 --> 00:19:16,104
Let's go.

187
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:20,904
Thank you.

188
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:29,200
I swear Keng isn't crazy.

189
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:32,680
He was hospitalized because of the stress.

190
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:34,590
He's afraid to sleep.

191
00:19:34,590 --> 00:19:38,028
Every time he does, he dreams of them.

192
00:19:40,239 --> 00:19:42,211
What does he dream about?

193
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:45,360
Same as before.

194
00:19:45,360 --> 00:19:48,030
Those three keep asking him for help.

195
00:19:48,030 --> 00:19:52,316
They want someone to take their place
so they can break the curse.

196
00:19:52,316 --> 00:19:56,824
Otherwise, they'll torment him
to death real soon.

197
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:05,200
You told me not to get involved.

198
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:08,068
If I keep the precepts
and dedicate merit to them,

199
00:20:08,068 --> 00:20:11,118
could it lessen the harm to Nat?

200
00:21:05,760 --> 00:21:06,960
What's up, Nat?

201
00:21:06,960 --> 00:21:09,401
You said you'd come see me yesterday.

202
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:12,520
Something came up.

203
00:21:12,520 --> 00:21:15,895
Hiding out at home with that cop is business?

204
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:19,112
<i>I don't want to argue, Nat.</i>

205
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:22,426
Once I'm done, I'll come see you.

206
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:33,222
Yo.

207
00:21:36,600 --> 00:21:38,624
May I share in your merit.

208
00:21:41,320 --> 00:21:43,386
If you see or sense anything,

209
00:21:43,386 --> 00:21:45,104
you have to stay focused.

210
00:21:48,147 --> 00:21:50,320
I'll be working out of town for a few days.

211
00:21:50,320 --> 00:21:53,520
Call me anytime.

212
00:21:53,520 --> 00:21:56,918
I'll leave your car here in case you need it.

213
00:21:59,139 --> 00:22:00,615
Thank you.

214
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:13,920
The merit I've made this time,

215
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:16,989
I dedicate to all those...

216
00:22:16,989 --> 00:22:22,304
whom my husband Nat Thanahirankit has wronged.

217
00:22:23,080 --> 00:22:26,080
May you receive this merit

218
00:22:26,080 --> 00:22:28,920
and forgive him.

219
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:32,106
May there be no more vengeance or karma
between you and him.

220
00:22:34,680 --> 00:22:36,200
I don't want your merit!

221
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:38,213
You have to die!

222
00:22:38,213 --> 00:22:39,240
Bastard Lert!

223
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:42,504
You must die and take our place!

224
00:23:06,886 --> 00:23:09,273
It's been three days and nights.

225
00:23:09,273 --> 00:23:12,413
Master Lert's been in his room with Kadkao.

226
00:23:19,640 --> 00:23:20,925
Who is it?

227
00:23:20,925 --> 00:23:22,006
Stop knocking!

228
00:23:22,006 --> 00:23:23,720
Are you asking for trouble?

229
00:23:27,733 --> 00:23:31,615
Oh! Bulan. Why are you back so soon?

230
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:35,611
I was worried about you.

231
00:23:36,487 --> 00:23:38,306
Why worry?

232
00:23:41,880 --> 00:23:44,108
Kadkao is here to take care of me.

233
00:23:45,080 --> 00:23:50,466
You can stay with your father
until he's fully recovered.

234
00:23:50,466 --> 00:23:51,587
And Bulan,

235
00:23:51,587 --> 00:23:54,118
make sure no one disturbs me again.

236
00:23:55,160 --> 00:23:58,440
Sroi, bring me my tonic.

237
00:23:59,080 --> 00:24:00,420
Yes, sir.

238
00:24:10,680 --> 00:24:12,640
Master Lert.

239
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:15,000
My lady is back.

240
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:17,817
Let her take care of you now.

241
00:24:19,560 --> 00:24:21,163
I love you.

242
00:24:21,163 --> 00:24:23,601
You're the only one I want, Kadkao.

243
00:24:58,720 --> 00:25:02,432
I replaced his tonic with poisonous herbs,
just as you ordered.

244
00:25:07,040 --> 00:25:10,800
Master Lert won't have the strength
to desire Kadkao anymore.

245
00:25:11,480 --> 00:25:13,280
But...

246
00:25:13,280 --> 00:25:14,500
What?

247
00:25:15,120 --> 00:25:19,840
The herbalist said
if Master Lert drinks too much,

248
00:25:19,840 --> 00:25:22,401
it could kill him.

249
00:25:24,200 --> 00:25:27,646
If he insists on being so obsessed with Kadkao,

250
00:25:27,646 --> 00:25:31,601
then whether he lives or dies is his problem.

251
00:25:50,120 --> 00:25:52,100
Did you hear that too, Sroi?

252
00:26:17,001 --> 00:26:18,341
Master.

253
00:26:18,341 --> 00:26:20,420
Here is your tonic.

254
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:34,523
Kadkao, where are my snacks?

255
00:26:40,440 --> 00:26:42,413
What happened to your foot?

256
00:26:52,160 --> 00:26:54,502
I stepped on a piece of metal.

257
00:26:57,400 --> 00:27:00,931
Sroi, get some medicine for Kadkao.

258
00:27:01,674 --> 00:27:03,003
Yes, sir.

259
00:27:36,080 --> 00:27:37,811
Your tonic, sir.

260
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:58,331
What's wrong with you?

261
00:28:02,520 --> 00:28:04,518
I asked what's wrong.

262
00:28:05,840 --> 00:28:08,173
I accidentally knocked it over, sir.

263
00:28:08,173 --> 00:28:11,220
I'll make you another tonic, sir.

264
00:28:12,280 --> 00:28:14,125
No need.

265
00:28:14,125 --> 00:28:15,820
I can drink this.

266
00:28:34,113 --> 00:28:35,900
Does it hurt badly?

267
00:28:55,040 --> 00:28:57,800
Hmm. I feel refreshed.

268
00:28:57,800 --> 00:28:59,916
Thank you so much, Bulan.

269
00:29:08,973 --> 00:29:13,007
Sroi, tend to Kadkao's wound as well.

270
00:29:33,560 --> 00:29:35,316
This tonic really works.

271
00:29:36,340 --> 00:29:38,321
Give some to Kadkao too.

272
00:29:42,000 --> 00:29:43,603
Yes.

273
00:30:27,320 --> 00:30:29,918
Master is so kind to you.

274
00:30:36,240 --> 00:30:37,611
Drink it.

275
00:31:08,200 --> 00:31:09,800
Kadkao.

276
00:31:09,800 --> 00:31:11,309
What's wrong?

277
00:31:11,960 --> 00:31:13,401
Kadkao!

278
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:18,211
Kadkao!

279
00:31:20,880 --> 00:31:21,960
Kadkao!

280
00:31:21,960 --> 00:31:23,807
What's wrong, Kadkao?

281
00:31:28,680 --> 00:31:32,811
Kadkao, what's happening to you?

282
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:39,417
The tonic you ordered
must be too strong for Kadkao.

283
00:31:40,189 --> 00:31:43,439
I warned you, but you wouldn't listen.

284
00:31:43,439 --> 00:31:44,760
You only cared about having fun.

285
00:31:44,760 --> 00:31:49,322
If Kadkao dies, it'll be because of your order.

286
00:31:50,520 --> 00:31:51,822
Kadkao!

287
00:31:53,118 --> 00:31:54,407
Kadkao!

288
00:31:58,080 --> 00:31:59,414
Kadkao!

289
00:32:00,160 --> 00:32:01,214
Kadkao!

290
00:32:02,880 --> 00:32:05,296
Kadkao! Kadkao!

291
00:32:43,560 --> 00:32:46,834
You're just going to let her
be happy with her lover?

292
00:32:46,834 --> 00:32:48,410
Lock her up.

293
00:32:49,160 --> 00:32:51,410
Make her yours forever.

294
00:32:51,410 --> 00:32:53,214
Just like you did before.

295
00:33:40,613 --> 00:33:42,303
Am I seeing things?

296
00:33:45,560 --> 00:33:47,112
Idiot.

297
00:34:15,775 --> 00:34:17,775
[Nat Thanahirankit]
[Yotaka]

298
00:34:34,520 --> 00:34:39,911
The attendant nun said
she heard you crying out all night.

299
00:34:42,120 --> 00:34:45,891
I dreamed about the past.

300
00:34:45,891 --> 00:34:47,716
I saw what happened.

301
00:34:48,869 --> 00:34:50,705
Everyone has their own karma.

302
00:34:51,560 --> 00:34:54,196
Anyway, I wish you well.

303
00:35:36,760 --> 00:35:38,320
A GPS tracker.

304
00:35:42,640 --> 00:35:44,906
Why did you give her the house?

305
00:35:44,906 --> 00:35:47,216
How could you do this to me?

306
00:35:48,320 --> 00:35:49,621
You're horrible!

307
00:35:49,621 --> 00:35:51,238
You're the worst!

308
00:35:51,238 --> 00:35:52,440
Hey! Wait!

309
00:35:52,440 --> 00:35:54,840
Pam, calm down.

310
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:56,120
Stop! Don't do this.

311
00:35:56,120 --> 00:35:58,406
What are you doing? Stop!

312
00:36:00,440 --> 00:36:02,021
This is none of your business.

313
00:36:02,592 --> 00:36:05,313
- Nat is my husband.
- So what?

314
00:36:08,040 --> 00:36:12,518
Wait! Stop! Stop!

315
00:36:17,640 --> 00:36:19,606
Get out of my house. Now!

316
00:36:20,480 --> 00:36:21,860
Your house?

317
00:36:21,860 --> 00:36:24,000
Yes, my house!

318
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:27,413
Get out! And don't ever come back!

319
00:36:29,760 --> 00:36:33,320
Wait! I said stop!

320
00:36:43,920 --> 00:36:45,920
Pam, stop!

321
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:47,203
That's enough!

322
00:36:47,203 --> 00:36:49,508
Have you both lost your minds?

323
00:36:54,120 --> 00:36:55,705
Pam, that's enough!

324
00:36:58,160 --> 00:37:00,620
Enough! I said stop!

325
00:37:01,280 --> 00:37:03,200
You're taking her side?

326
00:37:04,693 --> 00:37:05,913
Get out!

327
00:37:07,400 --> 00:37:09,116
I said get out!

328
00:37:10,680 --> 00:37:12,011
Get out!

329
00:37:17,443 --> 00:37:20,715
You'll regret treating me like this.

330
00:37:35,419 --> 00:37:36,708
Yo.

331
00:37:49,320 --> 00:37:51,108
Have some water, Yo.

332
00:38:07,280 --> 00:38:09,206
Are you okay?

333
00:38:11,680 --> 00:38:13,520
What's going on?

334
00:38:13,520 --> 00:38:15,513
Just tell me the truth.

335
00:38:17,680 --> 00:38:21,113
Pam misunderstood something about the house.

336
00:38:21,799 --> 00:38:23,308
What about the house?

337
00:38:24,160 --> 00:38:27,505
She saw your name on the title deed.

338
00:38:28,794 --> 00:38:31,908
Did she misunderstand, or did you let her?

339
00:38:37,720 --> 00:38:39,003
Nat.

340
00:38:40,186 --> 00:38:42,640
If Pam really drugged you,

341
00:38:42,640 --> 00:38:44,821
I'll do everything I can to help you.

342
00:38:45,529 --> 00:38:47,713
But you have to tell me the truth.

343
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:54,706
I believe you.

344
00:38:55,886 --> 00:38:57,815
I believe you won't leave me.

345
00:39:00,840 --> 00:39:04,820
You want my hair tested?
You want a blood test? I'll do it.

346
00:39:04,820 --> 00:39:06,263
You want to find out who drugged me?

347
00:39:06,263 --> 00:39:07,723
I'll let you.

348
00:39:09,600 --> 00:39:11,010
But Yo...

349
00:39:12,760 --> 00:39:15,016
you'll come back to me, right?

350
00:39:18,440 --> 00:39:21,115
Yo... Yo...

351
00:39:33,640 --> 00:39:34,815
You...

352
00:39:35,640 --> 00:39:38,198
You drugged me...

353
00:39:57,148 --> 00:39:58,200
<i>You choose.</i>

354
00:39:58,200 --> 00:40:02,725
<i>Will you fight back,
or die like before, Kadkao?</i>

355
00:40:02,725 --> 00:40:04,433
<i>Yo's spirit isn't in her body.</i>

356
00:40:04,433 --> 00:40:06,220
<i>You mean...</i>

357
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:13,480
<i>You'll suffer a thousand times more than I did.</i>

358
00:40:13,480 --> 00:40:14,718
<i>Yo!</i>

359
00:40:19,180 --> 00:40:21,108
<i>Keep your voice down.</i>

360
00:40:22,072 --> 00:40:24,721
<i>Or hell might find you.</i>
